--- The end of standard input is no line: `input[]` there is an error value,
--- so a loop reading every line ends. It had answered empty text that did
--- not fail, again and again (Rosetta Code, ABC correlation). The parity
--- harness gives a program no input.
line = input[]
log[line.ok]
log[line.reason]
n = 0
while line.ok
    n = n + 1
    line = input[]
log['read `n` lines']
